flowchart LR
  INV[Certified invoice]
  SELLER[Seller taxpayer]
  BUYER[Buyer taxpayer]
  OUT[Seller output VAT entry]
  IN[Buyer input VAT candidate]
  MATCH[Matching decision]
  PERIOD[Tax periods]
  RETS[Seller and buyer VAT returns]
  EXC[Exception case]

  SELLER --> INV --> BUYER
  INV --> OUT --> MATCH
  INV --> IN --> MATCH
  MATCH -->|matched| PERIOD --> RETS
  MATCH -->|mismatch, missing or duplicate| EXC
  EXC -->|resolved evidence| MATCH

